  "description": "Chausar takes the old board game of chausar and lays it out as a playground. The cross-shaped structure has a central tower at the meeting point and four arms with slides and climbers, each arm in its own colour. A team of four can each take a colour and race to the top, or children can make up their own rules. Chausar is sized for ages 5 to 12, with a capacity of 15 children. The product area is 34'7\" x 27'5\", with a safe play area of 40'7\" x 33'5\", so it needs a large park or school ground. Climbing, hanging, crawling, balancing and sliding build agility, body strength, strategy and confidence. Galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope carry a 3-year warranty. Call us to discuss your ground.",
